   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SDP201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.2</span>\n<h2>Grading: every mark and its weight</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Read this in week one — part of the grade is earned in class long before any exam.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13695 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SDP201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.2</span>\n<h2>Cách tính điểm: đủ mọi đầu điểm và trọng số</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đọc ngay tuần đầu — một phần điểm được tính trong lớp từ rất sớm, trước mọi kỳ thi.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13695 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Category<br><small>Đầu điểm</small></th><th>Type<br><small>Loại</small></th><th>Parts<br><small>Số phần</small></th><th>Weight<br><small>Trọng số</small></th><th>Completion criteria<br><small>Điều kiện hoàn thành</small></th><th>Duration<br><small>Thời lượng</small></th><th>CLO</th><th>Question type<br><small>Dạng câu hỏi</small></th><th>No. of questions<br><small>Số câu</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Assignment 1</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>15.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>in class and homework</td><td>CLO1, CLO2, CLO3</td><td>Individual project</td><td>Essay and presentation</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Assignment 2</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>25.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>in class and homework</td><td>CLO1, CLO2, CLO4, CLO5, CLO6</td><td>Individual project</td><td>Essay and presentation</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Final Project</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>45.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>in class and homework</td><td>CLO2, CLO3, CLO4, CLO5, CLO6</td><td>Group project</td><td>Report and presentation</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Participation &amp; Preparation &amp; Practice</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>15.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>in class</td><td>CLO6</td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The weights add up to <strong>100%</strong>. Minimum average to pass: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>How to read \"Completion criteria\":</em> it is the minimum score that one mark must reach (e.g. <code>&gt;0</code> = you must not get zero / must sit it; <code>4</code> = at least 4/10). Missing it can mean failing the subject even with a good average — this reading is the website's explanation, the table itself is the university's.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Tổng trọng số đúng <strong>100%</strong>. Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua môn: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>Cách đọc cột \"Điều kiện hoàn thành\":</em> là điểm tối thiểu đầu điểm đó phải đạt (vd <code>&gt;0</code> = không được 0 / phải dự; <code>4</code> = tối thiểu 4/10). Không đạt có thể trượt môn dù điểm trung bình cao — phần giải thích này là của web, bảng là của trường.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>The fine print per mark (verbatim)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Assignment 1</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Lecturer assesses students’ TVC sound design developed in class. Students must complete a 1-minute TVC sound.<br><em>Grading guide:</em> - Record and process sound effects<br><br>- Harmonize and mix audio elements for a TVC</li>\n<li><strong>Assignment 2</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Lecturer assesses students’ animated film sound design developed in class. Students must complete a 10-second animated film sound.<br><em>Grading guide:</em> - Record and process sound effects<br><br>- Harmonize and mix audio for an animated film</li>\n<li><strong>Final Project</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Lecturer assesses students’ film sound design developed in class. Students must complete a 10-second film sound.<br><em>Grading guide:</em> - Record and process sound effects<br><br>- Harmonize and mix audio for a film<br><br>- Apply corrections, effects, and sound aesthetics</li>\n<li><strong>Participation &amp; Preparation &amp; Practice</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> Evaluation based on learners’ preparation, class interaction, and completion of practice tasks.<br><em>Grading guide:</em> Recording and processing sound effects in class activities.</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Chi tiết từng đầu điểm (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Assignment 1</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Lecturer assesses students’ TVC sound design developed in class. Students must complete a 1-minute TVC sound.<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> - Record and process sound effects<br><br>- Harmonize and mix audio elements for a TVC</li>\n<li><strong>Assignment 2</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Lecturer assesses students’ animated film sound design developed in class. Students must complete a 10-second animated film sound.<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> - Record and process sound effects<br><br>- Harmonize and mix audio for an animated film</li>\n<li><strong>Final Project</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Lecturer assesses students’ film sound design developed in class. Students must complete a 10-second film sound.<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> - Record and process sound effects<br><br>- Harmonize and mix audio for a film<br><br>- Apply corrections, effects, and sound aesthetics</li>\n<li><strong>Participation &amp; Preparation &amp; Practice</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> Evaluation based on learners’ preparation, class interaction, and completion of practice tasks.<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> Recording and processing sound effects in class activities.</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
