   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SDP201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbook: <strong>Recording and Producing Audio for Media, Cengage Learning</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13695 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SDP201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Recording and Producing Audio for Media, Cengage Learning</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13695 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Recording and Producing Audio for Media, Cengage Learning</strong></td><td>Stanley R. Alten</td><td>Pearson.</td><td>2012</td><td></td><td><code>9781435460652</code></td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>Link: <a href=\"https://library.books24x7.com/toc.aspx?bookid=42741\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://library.books24x7.com/toc.aspx?bookid=42741</a></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Websites:<br>- <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s8uIFlfo4rc&list=PLF323DDC21E6DC960\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s8uIFlfo4rc&amp;list=PLF323DDC21E6DC960</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.lynda.com/learning-paths/Audio-Music/produce-audio-for-film-and-video-projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.lynda.com/learning-paths/Audio-Music/produce-audio-for-film-and-video-projects</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.lynda.com/learning-paths/Video/become-a-video-production-crewmember\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.lynda.com/learning-paths/Video/become-a-video-production-crewmember</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.udemy.com/adobe-audition-cc-audio-production-course-basics-to-expert\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.udemy.com/adobe-audition-cc-audio-production-course-basics-to-expert</a></strong></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Generative AI Content Creation: <a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/generative-ai-content-creation?msockid=3a69b956ec2d6e9d05b7a8feed3f6f5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/generative-ai-content-creation?msockid=3a69b956ec2d6e9d05b7a8feed3f6f5</a></strong></td><td>Coursera</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p>- Internet<br>- Adobe Audition</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p>- Internet<br>- Adobe Audition</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
