   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SDP201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.6</span>\n<h2>Student tasks & constructive questions</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">The rules you are held to (attendance, preparation, exam eligibility) — verbatim.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13695 · Decision 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 27/11/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SDP201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.6</span>\n<h2>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên & câu hỏi kiến tạo</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Những quy định bạn phải tuân theo (chuyên cần, chuẩn bị bài, điều kiện dự thi) — nguyên văn.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13695 · QĐ 1318/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 27/11/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student tasks (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>- Students must attend at least 80% of total class hours to be eligible for the final examination.<br>- Actively participate in all class activities.<br>- Complete all tasks assigned by the instructor after class.<br>- Use personal laptops only for learning purposes during class time.<br>- Read the textbook in advance before each session.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>- Students must attend at least 80% of total class hours to be eligible for the final examination.<br>- Actively participate in all class activities.<br>- Complete all tasks assigned by the instructor after class.<br>- Use personal laptops only for learning purposes during class time.<br>- Read the textbook in advance before each session.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions (41)</h3>\n<p>Questions the syllabus asks you to think through before or during the session — try answering them yourself first.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo (41)</h3>\n<p>Câu hỏi syllabus yêu cầu bạn suy nghĩ trước/trong buổi học — tự trả lời trước khi xem bài.</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>Session<br><small>Buổi</small></th><th>Code<br><small>Mã</small></th><th>Question (verbatim)<br><small>Câu hỏi (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td>QN2.1</td><td>What do we learn in SDP201?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td>QN3.1</td><td>How about the assessment in SDP201?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td>QN3.2</td><td>How do you think about the criteria of excellent marks in SDP201?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td>QN4.1</td><td>Describing The Healthy Ear</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td>QN5.1</td><td>How to reduce the noise and unwanted sounds in the rooms?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td>QN6.1</td><td>What is the difference between sound reflection, diffusion and absorption?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td>QN7.1</td><td>What are the pollarn patterns of microphones in the smartphones?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td>QN8.1</td><td>Are the more expensive mobile phones better for sound recording than the cheap ones?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td>QN9.1</td><td>The tips when using mobile phones for audio recording?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td>QN10.1</td><td>How to reduce the noise while and after recording?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td>QN11.1</td><td>Do we need any special application for recording on smartphone and why?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>12</td><td>QN12.1</td><td>What are the types of recording devices on the market?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>12</td><td>QN14.1</td><td>Can you tell us some important notes on recording voice using Adobe Audition?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>16</td><td>QN16.1</td><td>What have you learned from clips instructions on Adobe Audition?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>17</td><td>QN17.1</td><td>What have you learned from clips instructions on Adobe Audition?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>18</td><td>QN18.1</td><td>How to define the quality of a sound recording?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>20</td><td>QN20.1</td><td>What are the differences in sounds used in cartoons, short films, TVC?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>21</td><td>QN21.1</td><td>The process of noise reduction in a recording using Adobe Audition?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>22</td><td>QN22.1</td><td>How about some tips of the changing pitch in Adobe Audition?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>23</td><td>QN23.1</td><td>How do we edit a vocal?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>24</td><td>QN24.1</td><td>Can we use Adobe Audition to change the pitch of voice and how to do it?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>24</td><td>QN24.2</td><td>How about some tips of adjusting EQ and reverberatiton for vocal in Adobe Audition?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>25</td><td>QN25.1</td><td>How do we define a successful mixing sound?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>26</td><td>QN26.1</td><td>Can you hear the difference between analog, digital linear and compressed sound examples?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>27</td><td>QN27.1</td><td>What are the popular audio formats?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>28</td><td>QN28.1</td><td>What are the audio compression standards? How does compression affect sound quality?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>29</td><td>QN29.1</td><td>How about the tips in desining sounds for mobile media?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>30</td><td>QN30.1</td><td>Why and how do we create an immensive world in our projects?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>34</td><td>QN34.1</td><td>What is the difference between foley and sound ambience?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>35</td><td>QN35.1</td><td>How can we remove vocal from the sound file using Adobe Audition?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>36</td><td>QN36.1</td><td>What are the names of common types of sound effects?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>47</td><td>QN47.1</td><td>Who is a music producer? Name 5 famous music composers that you knew.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>47</td><td>QN47.2</td><td>For what the limitor and compressor is using?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>48</td><td>QN48.1</td><td>What is the difference between audio and music production?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>52</td><td>QN52.1</td><td>What are the tips for designing audio for interactive media?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>53</td><td>QN53.1</td><td>Analyze of some examples of audio in interactive media?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>54</td><td>QN54.1</td><td>What can you tell about the sound in gaming?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>55</td><td>QN55.1</td><td>What are common sound systems?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>55</td><td>QN55.2</td><td>How to treat acoustic in room well?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>56</td><td>QN56.1</td><td>How will you evaluate a sound project?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>58</td><td>QN58.1</td><td>What can you tell about the sound in one of individual projects?</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13695</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
